        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF147 WebGPU supported on all apple silicon]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28604</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28604"/>
        <updated>2025-12-15T01:10:27.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF147 supports WebGPU on on all macOS versions on apple silicon in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993341" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993341</a>.<br>
Previously it was only supported on Tahoe - I can't find a bug for that, but this issue stated that it was added for Tahoe in 145. It isn't supported on Linux. It isn't supported on macOS on Intel.</p>
<p dir="auto">I have updated the (partial) subfeatures in the 250+ places that support is recorded.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3699234339" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42247" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42247/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42247">mdn/content#42247</a></p>]]></content>
